BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:STEAM Club: LEGO
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T183000
UID:69ff9390278f7c2f008c281d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Builders of all ages are invited to drop in and create togethe
 r using LEGO® and DUPLO bricks. Families can free-build\, collaborate\, a
 nd let their imaginations run wild in this relaxed\, hands-on program desi
 gned for builders big and small.\nThis program is intended for ages 4+\nCh
 ildren under 5 must be accompanied by a parent/guardian\nThis is a drop in
  program but limited to a room capacity of 15 participants
LOCATION:Eglinton Square\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ff9390278f7c2f008c281d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
