DESCRIPTION:Author\nSarabeth Holden\n(Sea Snooze\; Benny the Bananasaurus 
 Rex) reads from her new children's book Strawberry Sundaes leads a short
  story writing workshop. The audience and author will come up with words t
 o base a story on\, then orally tell a story from their new collection of 
 words. Participants will be invited to then create their own story.\n​Th
 is creative writing workshop is for children 3- 8.
