UID:6a05f1a9b4506fca7c1f8fc4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will provide an overview about positive parentin
 g and review tips on specific ways parents/caregivers can help guide their
  children's behaviours. Topics covered include: temperament\, why children
  misbehave and positive parenting strategies that can be used to reduce di
 fficult behaviours.\nThis workshop is intended for parents and/or caregive
 rs. Children under the age of 6 are welcome.\nInformation Collection Notic
 e:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Publ
 ic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 2
 0(d). The information will only be used for event and program registration
