DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T120000
UID:6a06040df89ee1580052ee73@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate all things soccer with Riverdale’s screening of\nT
 he Big Green!\nA comedy about a group of bored misfits who become local so
 ccer heroes when a British schoolteacher new to Texas is determined to mot
 ivate her students and decides to form a soccer team. (1995\, 1h 40m\, Rat
 ed PG).
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a06040df89ee1580052ee73
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
