BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Puppet Show: And Tango Makes Three
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T110000
UID:6a04f014f6bd012f0067bf38@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:From the zoo to the stage!\nAt New York City's Central Park Zo
 o\, two male penguins become inseparable. When the pair take turns sitti
 ng on an abandoned egg\, they successfully hatch baby Tango. Adapted fr
 om the pioneering picture book\nAnd Tango Makes Three\n.\nAll families wel
 come. Drop-in\, no registration necessary.
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a04f014f6bd012f0067bf38
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
