DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260516T160000
UID:69da7db0491b809c6f26b321@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Help us celebrate the branch's 102nd birthday with a Big Book
  Sale and Open House!\nBuy used books\, comics\, CDs\, DVDs\, audiobooks 
 and magazines. Book Sale Special: Purchase a canvas bag for $8 and fill it
  with books.\nParticipate in a scavenger hunt (adult scavenger hunt on the
  main floor\, children's scavenger hunt on the second floor).\nMake a book
 mark (10am-4pm\, second floor).\nMake a TPL button (11am-12pm\, second flo
 or).\nExplore your library and enjoy our collection!\nAll proceeds from th
 e book sale support the Toronto Public Library.
