DESCRIPTION:Join us for stories\, songs\, rhymes and activities in this pr
 ogram for children ages 5 and under and their parents or caregivers. Follo
 wed by a one-hour workshop with a Toronto Public Health Nurse or Nutrition
  Educator on positive parenting strategies and tips. Children\, parents a
 nd caregivers are invited to Stay and Play\, from 10:30 am to12 pm.\nDates
  if upcoming workshops available in both English and Mandarin:\nMay 25\nJu
 ne 1\nJune 8\nJune 15\nJune 22\nJune 29\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
