DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T133000
UID:69f6148bfb87a3c2e2ad5a34@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Meet some incredible animal ambassadors up close during this i
 nteractive program that introduces children and families to cute and fuzzy
  mammals including different breeds of rabbits\, along with other adorabl
 e furries\, while teaching about habitats\, adaptations\, and respectful 
 animal care. With engaging stories and opportunities for safe interaction\
 , this live animal presentation will inspire curiosity\, empathy\, and a l
 ove of wildlife.\nThis program is for ages 5 & up\nAll participants attend
 ing including adults and kids must register for this program.\nInformation
  Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by
  the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a
