UID:69d7e3f25c04bc0fc061de08@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Children are welcome to explore self-expression with nail pain
 ting and making beaded bracelets as well as ribbon butterfly hairclips!\nS
 taff will provide non-toxic nail polish for children and caregivers to app
 ly to their fingernails. Nail polish can easily be removed by either peeli
 ng when dry or washing hands in warm water.\nFor school-aged children and 
