UID:69f0d6ef24bd39b0b5e8c8d8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Nancy is a widely recognized children's music and finger play 
 poem composer and content creator. Her work is used worldwide by parents\,
  educators\, therapists\, caregivers and children's programmers. Nancy's s
 ongs and poems are easy to learn and follow-and she is currently touring t
 he Toronto Public Library circuit\, sharing her family friendly fun throug
 hout the city.\nNancy's performances are focussed on families with babies\
 , toddlers and big kids\, too. Bring your whole family-and your own inner 
 child\, too!\nDrop-in\, no registration required.\nAges 0-8
