BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Play: Keva Blocks & Feltro
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T170000
UID:69dd50b6e2a2952aed0e87e2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Introducing Free Play\, a designated space for kids to hang
  out and enjoy STEM programs at their own pace. This program will run eve
 ry Thursday night for the month of May.\nThis week we have Keva Blocks/Fe
 ltro free play! Come relax with us while we build and create structures of
  all shapes and sizes!\nDrop-in. Limited space.\nAges 0 - 12.\nThe program
  will take place in the Auditorium located in the basement. Elevator on si
 te. If you have any questions\, please call Bendale Branch at 416-396-8910
 .
LOCATION:Bendale\, Auditorium  - Basement
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69dd50b6e2a2952aed0e87e2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
