DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T150000
UID:69c68cc62866a5b48844bddc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Appleseed Yoga presents an interactive\, movement-based progra
 m where stories come alive with our bodies! Class begins and ends with son
 g and breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. No e
 xperience\, mats\, or materials required.\nAges 4-8. Registration required
LOCATION:Richview\, Lower Level
