DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260714T153000
UID:69c5833181b67dfe32af32c4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Find your "inner magic" with The Amazing Magic Mel during this
  upbeat\, hilarious and interactive magical experience.  Expect a healthy 
 dose of participation and self-empowerment as she leads aspiring magicians
  of all ages on a journey to become "official magicians" during this fast-
 paced\, comedy magic show for the entire family.\nSuitable for children 3 
 years old and up with their parent or caregiver. This program can hold up
  to 60 guests including adults with their children.\nWhen signing up pleas
 e indicate the number of people in your party including both children and
  adults\n. Adults are expected to accompany children to this program.\nInf
 ormation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is coll
 ected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, secti
 ons 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event
  and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how t
 he library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at
 \nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2
 G8.
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale\, Program will be held on the second floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c5833181b67dfe32af32c4
