BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Picture Book Reading and Art Workshop with Author Farida Zaman
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T143000
UID:69efb2ae213814b1b5253ea2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join author and illustrator Farida Zaman for a reading of her 
 picture book\nMeena Can’t Wait\n. In the story\, Meena is excited for he
 r tea party at her nanu’s house\, but even though sheʼs hungry\, sheʼs
  going to have to be patient. The reading will be followed by an art activ
 ity. Farida Zaman is an illustrator of 16 books and an author illustrator 
 of 3 books\, including\nI Want to Be... A Gutsy Girls’ ABC\n\, and\nAliy
 a’s Secret: A Story of Ramadan\n.\nThis program is for children ages 4-8
  & their caregivers.\nDrop in. Space is limited. Please contact the branch
  for groups larger than 5.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Auditorium.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69efb2ae213814b1b5253ea2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T150000
UID:69f0bb95cdd2f7e31fe37cd9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where we r
 ead stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Join Megan Snider\, 
 author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspiring st
 ories and gets the whole family moving. Class begins and ends with song an
 d breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kids and
  families can sit quietly and listen\, do partial poses or make up their o
 wn\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga! No experience\, mats\, or material
 s required.
LOCATION:Northern District\, Room 224
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f0bb95cdd2f7e31fe37cd9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
